	// The current credit number reflects the current usage on the node. For example, configuring a medium load balancer on a node consumes 10 credits. If there are 2 medium instances configured on a node, the current credit number is 2 \* 10 = 20. format: int64
	CurrentCreditNumber *int64
	// The number of large load balancer services configured on the node. format: int64
	CurrentLargeLoadBalancerServices *int64
	// The number of medium load balancer services configured on the node. format: int64
	CurrentMediumLoadBalancerServices *int64
	// The number of pool members configured on the node. format: int64
	CurrentPoolMembers *int64
